  "notes": "DISPATCH (Head of R&D, Nov 13 01:58Z): behind POLGAPH's lists job. Pages: 26 lists at most 3 pages of 1,000 (78 pages) plus 3 series reads = 81 at most; cap 90 leaves headroom for 429 retries. Size estimate about 1.7 KB a market: golf head-to-head and 3-ball series may fill their 3 pages (about 5 MB each), the rest are small; expected 20 to 60 MB, worst case about 135 MB, under the 200 MB run cap. Window Aug 1 to Nov 12, 2026 is fixed and never extended. GOLF IS A SLOW FAMILY (about 45 tournaments a year) WITH NO FORWARD LOG: the most any golf clause can reach is the slow-family paper list, never the research bar; the same holds for UFC, boxing and motorsport events. Awards series are left out (no settlement inside the window).",
